      "observations": [
        {
          "actual": "Do I need prior business experience to take courses on Coursera? No. Coursera is designed to guide learners at every stage—from aspiring professionals to advanced specialists. Many of Coursera’s business courses don’t require prior experience. Foundational business courses cover essential management, marketing, finance, and entrepreneurship concepts. Explore each course’s page to see the skills you’ll learn, their difficulty levels, and any recommended preparation, so you can start learning at a level that matches your business background.",
